{
  "format": 0,
  "id": "bourgoin-144-octagon-bands",
  "title": "Octagon bands of Bourgoin plate 144",
  "short": "Bourgoin 144 octagons",
  "subtitle": "Bourgoin, plate 144",
  "given": {"O": "The centre of an eight-pointed star.", "A": "Sets the circle inside the guide octagon."},
  "fold": 4,
  "star": 8,
  "style": "Islamic",
  "region": "Books and other",
  "level": "advanced",
  "construction": {
    "basis": "reconstruction",
    "fidelity": "not-applicable",
    "note": "The finished design was read from Wichmann’s P144 drawing. A 22.5-degree frame turn reveals its primitive square repeat. The guide octagon touches the unit circle, and its corners give the star. The star-side crossing P and compass transfers set the remaining parallels at exact square-root-of-two values. An axis-aligned cell chosen from neighbouring source stars would give a false repeat. The drawing gives no steps; we devised the construction.",
    "changes": "The compass steps, their order and the named points are ours. The frame is turned by 22.5 degrees. The 3 pt bands are represented by their centre lines. The palette is illustrative; no photograph was checked.",
    "reviewed": "2026-10-26"
  },
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "Tiling Search, data12/P144: Bourgoin, plate 144",
      "creator": "Brian Wichmann",
      "kind": "drawing",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data12/P144.html",
      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. His references are Bourgoin plate 144 (using the same tiles as plate 52); Keith Critchlow, Islamic Patterns (1976), page 187; and Abas and Salman, Symmetries of Islamic Geometrical Patterns (1995), page 250. His page links Wade BOU 144."
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Draw a horizontal straight line through O and A. Draw a circle with centre O through A.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through O. The two lines cross the circle at A, B, C and D. Draw a vertical line through each of A and B. Draw a horizontal line through each of C and D. The lines through A and C cross at J. Draw the line through O that halves the angle AOC. It crosses the circle at E, above O.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "C": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "B": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "D": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "ax": {"line": {"through": "A", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "cy": {"line": {"through": "C", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "bx": {"line": {"through": "B", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "dy": {"line": {"through": "D", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "J": {"point": {"meet": ["ax", "cy"]}},
        "d45": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["A", "O", "C"]}},
        "E": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Draw a line through E at 90° to line OE. Turn it round O by 90°, three times. With the four sides of the square, these lines make an octagon with corners S1 to S8.",
      "create": {
        "tt": {"line": {"through": "E", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "ttp": {"repeat": {"of": ["tt"], "by": "rot4"}},
        "S1": {"point": {"meet": ["ax", "tt"]}},
        "S2": {"point": {"meet": ["cy", "tt"]}},
        "S3": {"point": {"meet": ["cy", "tt@1"]}},
        "S4": {"point": {"meet": ["bx", "tt@1"]}},
        "S5": {"point": {"meet": ["bx", "tt@2"]}},
        "S6": {"point": {"meet": ["dy", "tt@2"]}},
        "S7": {"point": {"meet": ["dy", "tt@3"]}},
        "S8": {"point": {"meet": ["ax", "tt@3"]}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Draw the star at O as two squares.",
      "animate": "ruler",
      "parts": [
        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S1 and S3, S3 and S5, S5 and S7, and S7 and S1. Draw each line long.",
          "create": {
            "q01": {"line": {"through": ["S1", "S3"]}},
            "q02": {"line": {"through": ["S3", "S5"]}},
            "q03": {"line": {"through": ["S5", "S7"]}},
            "q04": {"line": {"through": ["S7", "S1"]}}
          },
          "animate": "ruler"
        },
        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S2 and S4, S4 and S6, S6 and S8, and S8 and S2. Draw each line long.",
          "create": {
            "q11": {"line": {"through": ["S2", "S4"]}},
            "q12": {"line": {"through": ["S4", "S6"]}},
            "q13": {"line": {"through": ["S6", "S8"]}},
            "q14": {"line": {"through": ["S8", "S2"]}}
          },
          "animate": "ruler"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre A through O. It crosses the horizontal line at F, beyond A. Keep the compass open to OJ. Draw circles with centres F and G1 in turn. They cross the horizontal line at G1 and G2, to the right.",
      "create": {
        "ca": {"circle": {"centre": "A", "through": "O"}},
        "F": {"point": {"meet": ["ca", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cg1": {"circle": {"centre": "F", "radiusFrom": ["O", "J"]}},
        "G1": {"point": {"meet": ["cg1", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cg2": {"circle": {"centre": "G1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "J"]}},
        "G2": {"point": {"meet": ["cg2", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre O through G2. It crosses the horizontal and vertical lines at T1 to T4. Draw a vertical line through each of T1 and T3. Draw a horizontal line through each of T2 and T4. They make a square with corners K1, K2, K3 and K4.",
      "create": {
        "co": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "G2"}},
        "T1": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}},
        "T2": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "T3": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "T4": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "gx": {"line": {"through": "T1", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "gy": {"line": {"through": "T2", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "gxw": {"line": {"through": "T3", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "gys": {"line": {"through": "T4", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "K1": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gy"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gy"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gys"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gys"]}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "The lines from S7 to S1 and from S8 to S2 cross at P. Draw lines through P parallel to the lines from S1 to S3 and from S2 to S4. Turn both lines round O by 90°, three times. The first new line crosses the vertical line through O at Z, above O.",
      "create": {
        "P": {"point": {"meet": ["q04", "q14"]}},
        "p00": {"line": {"through": "P", "parallelTo": "q01"}},
        "p01": {"line": {"through": "P", "parallelTo": "q11"}},
        "pp": {"repeat": {"of": ["p00", "p01"], "by": "rot4"}},
        "Z": {"point": {"meet": ["p00", "v"]}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre O and radius OF. It crosses the vertical line at N, above O. Draw circles with centres N and M in turn, keeping radius OF. They cross the vertical line at M and V, above their centres. Draw lines through N and V parallel to the lines from S1 to S3 and from S2 to S4. Turn these four lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "cn": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "radiusFrom": ["O", "F"]}},
        "N": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "cm": {"circle": {"centre": "N", "radiusFrom": ["O", "F"]}},
        "M": {"point": {"meet": ["cm", "v"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cv": {"circle": {"centre": "M", "radiusFrom": ["O", "F"]}},
        "V": {"point": {"meet": ["cv", "v"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "n00": {"line": {"through": "N", "parallelTo": "q01"}},
        "n01": {"line": {"through": "N", "parallelTo": "q11"}},
        "n10": {"line": {"through": "V", "parallelTo": "q01"}},
        "n11": {"line": {"through": "V", "parallelTo": "q11"}},
        "np": {"repeat": {"of": ["n00", "n01", "n10", "n11"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre M and radius OP. It crosses the vertical line at U1 and U2. Draw lines through both points parallel to the lines from S1 to S3 and from S2 to S4. Turn these four lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "cu": {"circle": {"centre": "M", "radiusFrom": ["O", "P"]}},
        "U1": {"point": {"meet": ["cu", "v"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "U2": {"point": {"meet": ["cu", "v"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "u00": {"line": {"through": "U1", "parallelTo": "q01"}},
        "u01": {"line": {"through": "U1", "parallelTo": "q11"}},
        "u10": {"line": {"through": "U2", "parallelTo": "q01"}},
        "u11": {"line": {"through": "U2", "parallelTo": "q11"}},
        "up": {"repeat": {"of": ["u00", "u01", "u10", "u11"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre M and radius OZ. It crosses the vertical line at W1 and W2. Draw lines through both points parallel to the lines from S1 to S3 and from S2 to S4. Turn these four lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "cw": {"circle": {"centre": "M", "radiusFrom": ["O", "Z"]}},
        "W1": {"point": {"meet": ["cw", "v"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "W2": {"point": {"meet": ["cw", "v"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "w00": {"line": {"through": "W1", "parallelTo": "q01"}},
        "w01": {"line": {"through": "W1", "parallelTo": "q11"}},
        "w10": {"line": {"through": "W2", "parallelTo": "q01"}},
        "w11": {"line": {"through": "W2", "parallelTo": "q11"}},
        "wp": {"repeat": {"of": ["w00", "w01", "w10", "w11"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre T2 through O. It crosses the vertical line again at X, beyond T2. Draw a circle with centre X and radius from O to W2. It crosses the vertical line at Y, towards O. Draw lines through Y parallel to the lines from S1 to S3 and from S2 to S4. Turn both lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "cx": {"circle": {"centre": "T2", "through": "O"}},
        "X": {"point": {"meet": ["cx", "v"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cy2": {"circle": {"centre": "X", "radiusFrom": ["O", "W2"]}},
        "Y": {"point": {"meet": ["cy2", "v"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "y00": {"line": {"through": "Y", "parallelTo": "q01"}},
        "y01": {"line": {"through": "Y", "parallelTo": "q11"}},
        "yp": {"repeat": {"of": ["y00", "y01"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Join K1, K2, K3 and K4 to mark the tile that repeats.",
      "create": {"tile": {"polygon": ["K1", "K2", "K3", "K4"]}},
      "animate": "fade"
    }
  ],
